# Line endings are part of the source: byte-exact checks (exported schemas, generated maps, hashes) must give the same
# answer on every machine. Text is stored and checked out with LF; Windows scripts that need CRLF are listed below.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
